# SUNSET KEYS v3 — Port Alba

An original open-world crime game in the spirit of GTA 6, built for the
[make.fun GTA 6 bounty](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01). One city, one sunset,
ten jobs — and a debt that only ends when Mara Voss owns the evening.

## The game

**Port Alba** is a sun-soaked harbour city with five districts that look and
feel different: glass-and-neon **Downtown**, brick **Old Town**, mixed
**Crosstown**, the boardwalk and animated bay of the **Marina**, and the
**Lighthouse Point** at the south-east edge.

- **Explore on foot and by car** — steal parked cars (or jack moving traffic),
  drive with drift physics, skid marks, tire smoke and damage; sail a
  speedboat out of the Marina.
- **Traffic and pedestrians** — 26 cars drive the road grid, 46 pedestrians
  walk the sidewalks and flee from danger; traffic slows, turns and respawns
  so the streets never empty out.
- **Wanted level, 0–5 stars** — foot cops at 1 star, patrol cars at 2+,
  roadblocks at 3+, and a police helicopter with a searchlight at 4–5 stars.
  Heat cools off when you lay low — unless the helicopter has you in its beam.
- **10 story missions** with a branching choice (go LOUD or QUIET after the
  lighthouse meeting), plus a 3-lap street race with rubber-banding rivals,
  deliveries, a boat chase, a storm run and a 5-star sunset getaway finale.
- **Day/night cycle and weather** — golden-hour sunset, neon nights, rain and
  fog; the lighthouse beam sweeps the bay after dark.
- **HUD** — wanted stars, cash, health, ammo, mission-tracker checklist,
  speedometer, damage bar, radio stations, and a live minimap with mission,
  police and helicopter blips. Pause menu with map, save/load via
  localStorage, synthesized WebAudio engine, sirens and radio (no audio files).

## Play

```sh
node serve.ts
# open http://localhost:8080
```

WASD move / drive · E enter car or boat · Space shoot (or click) · Shift boost ·
M start mission · P pause · S save · R radio · H horn · 1 / 2 story choice.

## Files

- `game/main.js` — bootstrap, loop, input, camera, shot staging
- `game/city.js` — Port Alba districts, roads, buildings, collision
- `game/vehicles.js` — traffic, player-car drift physics, police rams
- `game/pedestrians.js` — crowds, foot cops, patrol cars, helicopter, bullets
- `game/missions.js` — 10 missions, objectives, branching
- `game/story.js` — Mara Voss story arc and dialogue
- `game/races.js` — Crosstown street race, 3 laps, rivals
- `game/daynight.js` — day/night cycle, weather, sky tint
- `game/water.js` — Marina bay, docks, lighthouse beam
- `game/boats.js` — speedboats, wake, boat controls
- `game/effects.js` — particles, skid marks, screen shake, banners
- `game/hud.js` — HUD, minimap, menus, dialogue
- `game/audio.js` — synthesized WebAudio engine, sirens, radio
- `game/save.js` — localStorage save / load
- `game/state.js` — shared world state and seeded RNG
- `main.ts` — entrypoint: copies game/ + screenshots/ to /output, writes dossier.json
- `serve.ts` — static server for local play

